        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Joint Special Operations Command\n- People: Charles Alvin Beckwith\n- Events: Operation Eagle Claw, Malayan Emergency, Vietnam War\n- Roles: Colonel\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Alvin Beckwith served in the Malayan Emergency.\n- Charles Alvin Beckwith served in the Vietnam War.\n- Charles Alvin Beckwith attained the rank of colonel before his retirement.\n- Operation Eagle Claw failed before 1980.\n- Joint Special Operations Command was established in 1980.\n- Joint Special Operations Command was established on the recommendation of Colonel Charlie Beckwith after the failure of Operation Eagle Claw.",
